259
00:11:22.049 --> 00:11:23.548
Ben je zeker?

260
00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:25.216
Er zijn cheez-its daarbinnen.

261
00:11:25.218 --> 00:11:27.252
Cheez-its?!

262
00:11:28.154 --> 00:11:30.055
